OL,3,GNEWSAFloodlit football returns to
OL,4,Aground after decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football ground is set to host its
OL,7,Ffirst floodlit match in 10 years as
OL,8,Fpart of plans to boost its use.
OL,10,FNewbury FC will play against Burghfield
OL,11,FFC at Faraday Road on Wednesday.
OL,13,FThe site was left unused after the club
OL,14,Fwas evicted in 2018, and much of it was
OL,15,Fdestroyed in an arson attack in 2021,
OL,16,Fbefore it reopened in 2023.
OL,18,FThe six new lights, part of a #1.25m
OL,19,Fcouncil plan for the ground, are
OL,20,Frequired at the level the club hopes to
OL,21,Fbe promoted to this season.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
